<% content_for :head do %>
<style>
 .demo{margin:1rem;max-width:1200px}
 #presence{margin:.4rem 0;min-height:1.5rem}.chip{color:#fff;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;margin-right:4px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:3px}
 .row{display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:.5rem 0}
 .row button,.row form button,.stage-buttons button{border:1px solid #d1d5db;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;cursor:pointer;font:13px system-ui;padding:5px 10px;min-height:32px}
 .row button[disabled],.row form button[disabled]{opacity:.55;cursor:default}
 .row button[aria-pressed=true],.stage-buttons button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#1f2937;color:#fff;border-color:#1f2937}
 #say-form{display:flex;gap:4px}#say{font:13px system-ui;padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:6px;min-width:160px}
 #palette{display:flex;gap:4px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 0 6px;margin:.5rem 0;scrollbar-width:thin}
 #palette button{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;padding:4px 6px;border:2px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font:11px system-ui;min-width:56px;min-height:44px}
 #palette button canvas{width:32px;height:32px;image-rendering:pixelated}
 #palette button[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#1f2937;background:#f3f4f6}
 #stage{position:relative;width:100%;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;background:#3b6f96;border:2px solid #3f2631;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;line-height:0}
 #stage canvas.layer{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;image-rendering:pixelated;display:block}
 #stage #map{position:relative}
 #tint{pointer-events:none}
 #tags{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;line-height:1}
 .tag{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-100%);font:bold 10px system-ui;color:#fff;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;white-space:nowrap}
 .tag.me{outline:1px solid #fff}
 .sign-text{position:absolute;transform:translate(-50%,-115%);font:bold 9px system-ui;color:#3f2631;background:#fff8e1;border:1px solid #bd6c4a;padding:1px 3px;border-radius:2px;white-space:nowrap}
 #offline-badge{position:absolute;top:8px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#b91c1c;color:#fff;font:bold 13px system-ui;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;letter-spacing:.02em;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.3);line-height:1;pointer-events:none}
 #hud{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:8px;background:rgba(17,24,39,.78);color:#fff;font:12px/1.5 system-ui;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px;pointer-events:none;line-height:1.5}
 #hud b{color:#fde68a}
 #minimap{position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;width:144px;height:144px;image-rendering:pixelated;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);border-radius:4px;background:#3b6f96;cursor:pointer}
 .stage-buttons{position:absolute;right:8px;top:8px;display:flex;gap:4px;line-height:1}
 .stage-buttons button{font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;min-height:28px;opacity:.92}
 #status{font-size:.9rem;color:#374151}
 #status.offline{color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600}
 .legend{font-size:.85rem;color:#374151}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:3px;border-radius:2px}
 details.panel{margin:.75rem 0;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:.4rem .75rem}
 details.panel summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
 #timelapse-scrub{flex:1;min-width:160px}
 .copy{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.45}
 .hint{font-size:.8rem;color:#6b7280}
 code{background:#f3f4f6;padding:0 3px;border-radius:3px}
 @media (max-width:640px){.demo{margin:.5rem}.copy,.hint{display:none}h1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:.3rem 0}#minimap{width:96px;height:96px}#hud{font-size:11px}}
</style>
<% end %>
<div class="demo">
  <header>
    <h1>The city</h1>
    <%= render "nav" %>
    <p class="copy">
      A town on a 96 by 96 grid, with a bay along one edge and hills that come
      from one seed. Everyone paints tiles from their phone, and a Ruby planner
      lives in the town and builds what is missing. Each cell is one key in a
      <code>Y.Map</code>; a house two cells wide is one key, <code>victorian_teal@2x2</code>,
      at its corner. Paints to different cells merge. Two paints to the same
      cell keep the last one.
    </p>
    <p class="copy">
      The planner (<code>CityPlanner</code>) joins over the same websocket as a
      browser. It marks where it will build, walks there, and lays one tile at a
      time, writing the tile and its author together; up a hill it lays cable
      car track. Paint near its markers and it stops and moves on. A sign that
      says <code>PARK</code>, <code>SHOP</code>, <code>ROAD</code>, <code>BRIDGE</code>,
      <code>NO BUILD</code>, or <code>CLEAR</code> is an instruction. With a model
      key set, a mayor reads any other sign into one of those and names the
      streets. The townsfolk (<code>CityLife</code>) are another peer: everything
      that moves is its presence, never the document. Go offline, keep
      painting, reconnect: your tiles and everyone else's merge.
    </p>
    <div id="presence"></div>
    <p id="status">connecting…</p>
  </header>
  <div class="row">
    <button type="button" id="offline">Go offline</button>
    <button type="button" id="attribution" aria-pressed="false">Show who built what</button>
    <%= button_to "Invite the planner", document_city_planner_path(@document_id), class: "invite-planner", form: { style: "display:inline" } %>
    <%= button_to "Wake the town", document_city_life_path(@document_id), class: "invite-life", form: { style: "display:inline" } %>
    <button type="button" id="sound" aria-pressed="false">Sound off</button>
    <form id="say-form"><input id="say" type="text" maxlength="60" placeholder="Say something…" aria-label="say something"><button type="submit">Say</button></form>
    <span class="legend" id="legend" hidden><i style="background:#2563eb"></i>people <i style="background:#e38628"></i>planner <i style="background:#a855f7"></i>mayor</span>
  </div>
  <p class="hint">Drag to paint, scroll or pinch to zoom, drag with the walk tool (or the right button) to pan. Arrow keys walk, space hops, double tap hops.</p>
  <div id="palette" role="toolbar" aria-label="tiles"></div>
  <div id="stage" data-document-id="<%= @document_id %>:city">
    <canvas id="map" class="layer" aria-label="the town"></canvas>
    <canvas id="overlay" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <canvas id="tint" class="layer" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div id="tags" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div id="offline-badge" hidden>OFFLINE</div>
    <div id="hud" aria-live="off">people here <b id="hud-people">0</b> · tiles <b id="hud-tiles">0</b> · planner's roads <b id="hud-roads">0</b><br>the planner: <b id="hud-said">…</b></div>
    <div class="stage-buttons">
      <button type="button" id="follow" aria-pressed="false">Follow the planner</button>
      <button type="button" id="jump">Jump to me</button>
    </div>
    <canvas id="minimap" width="96" height="96" aria-label="minimap"></canvas>
  </div>
  <details class="panel" id="timelapse" data-url="<%= document_audit_path("#{@document_id}:city") %>">
    <summary>Timelapse, replayed from the update log</summary>
    <p class="copy">
      Every change the server recorded, applied in order to a fresh <code>Y.Doc</code>
      in this page, with a frame along the way. Nothing kept the history separately.
    </p>
    <div class="row">
      <button type="button" id="timelapse-play">Play</button>
      <input id="timelapse-scrub" type="range" min="0" max="0" value="0" aria-label="timelapse position">
      <button type="button" id="timelapse-refresh">Refresh</button>
      <span id="timelapse-caption"></span>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>
<script src="/city.js" defer></script>
